 716:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Port/Std/IfxPort.h **** 
 717:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Port/Std/IfxPort.h **** /** \brief Enable the Pin Controller Selection.
