 758:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Port/Std/IfxPort.h **** /** \brief Return the port group state.
 759:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Port/Std/IfxPort.h ****  *
 760:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Port/Std/IfxPort.h ****  * \param[in] port     Pointer to the port which should be accessed.
 761:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Port/Std/IfxPort.h ****  * \param[in] pinIndex Start at the given pin. Range: 0 to 15.
 762:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Port/Std/IfxPort.h ****  * \param[in] mask     Selects the pins which should be read (starting from pinIndex). Range: 0 to 
 763:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Port/Std/IfxPort.h ****  *
 764:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Port/Std/IfxPort.h ****  * \retval uint32 Returns the selected pin values. Range: 0 to 0xFFFFFFFF.
