 775:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Port/Std/IfxPort.h **** /** \brief Set the port group state.
 776:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Port/Std/IfxPort.h ****  *
 777:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Port/Std/IfxPort.h ****  * \param[inout] port     Pointer to the port which should be accessed.
