 779:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Port/Std/IfxPort.h ****  * \param[in]    mask     Selects the pins which should be modified (starting from pinIndex). Range
 780:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Port/Std/IfxPort.h ****  * \param[in]    data     Specifies the value which should be set. Range: 0 to 0xFFFF.
